    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's very simple. All you have to do is choose a person.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a person you'd be fine spending the rest of your life with.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And then press the button corresponding to that person!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Feeling Death&quot; is a mystery adventure game where you find yourself trapped in a deadly matchmaking game - one where becoming a couple means instant death. Through interactions and investigations with other participants, you'll need to find a way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this matchmaking game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/6bd3d36b4237da0b7d17c6bda3a00277.avif?t=1741324104\" width=640 height=256 /></span>Everyone chooses a person, and if two people choose each other, that's a couple made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Feeling Death&quot;, if a match is made, that couple dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/268149ef401732bae89951304dbb6ec2.avif?t=1741324104\" width=640 height=360 /></span>The matchmaking game takes place around a round table, and it's up to you to decide who to choose in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/546752ddf06eae5c7271a04a3731fea7.avif?t=1741324104\" width=640 height=360 /></span>Deaths occur not only from successful matches but also from murders. Trapped in a sealed hotel with no escape, you must explore its grounds and uncover the truth behind it all.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's very simple. All you have to do is choose a person.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a person you'd be fine spending the rest of your life with.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And then press the button corresponding to that person!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Feeling Death&quot; is a mystery adventure game where you find yourself trapped in a deadly matchmaking game - one where becoming a couple means instant death. Through interactions and investigations with other participants, you'll need to find a way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this matchmaking game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/6bd3d36b4237da0b7d17c6bda3a00277.avif?t=1741324104\" width=640 height=256 /></span>Everyone chooses a person, and if two people choose each other, that's a couple made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Feeling Death&quot;, if a match is made, that couple dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/268149ef401732bae89951304dbb6ec2.avif?t=1741324104\" width=640 height=360 /></span>The matchmaking game takes place around a round table, and it's up to you to decide who to choose in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/546752ddf06eae5c7271a04a3731fea7.avif?t=1741324104\" width=640 height=360 /></span>Deaths occur not only 